stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Unresolved: Extraction Phase (Phase 1)
    note right of Unresolved: In a Union disjunction,each member is an Unresolved reference

    state "Semantic Resolution (Phase 2)" as ResPhase {
        Unresolved --> ResolutionQuery: Query Building (ρ_build via Δ)
        
        ResolutionQuery --> Resolved: Match (Workspace Component)
        ResolutionQuery --> External: Match (External Library)
        ResolutionQuery --> Prim: Match (Primitive Registry P)
        ResolutionQuery --> EvaluatedAccess: Member / Call Chain
        ResolutionQuery --> Failed: No Scope Match
    }

    Resolved --> GraphGeneration: Phase 3 (Direct Edge)
    External --> GraphGeneration: Phase 3 (External Edge + Node)
    Prim --> GraphGeneration: Phase 3 (Primitive Edge + Node)
    EvaluatedAccess --> GraphGeneration: Phase 3 (Receiver + Type Edges)

    Failed --> [*]: Preserved for Recall / Diagnostics
    GraphGeneration --> [*]: Closed Dependency Graph G = (V, E)
